os usando alguna técnica de aprendizaje adecuada. Puedes utilizar como predictores métricas que caractericen a los nodos (de centralidad, distancia, conexión, ...).\n","4. Evalúa la calidad del modelo sobre el conjunto de prueba usando el área bajo la curva (tu modelo debe tener por lo menos un AUC de $0.82$ evaluada sobre el conjunto de prueba)."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["###1.-Ignora los casos en los que no se tiene registrada la variable."],"metadata":{"id":"qkBCLlx50Rjp"},"id":"qkBCLlx50Rjp"},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Identificamos los nodos con un valor numérico válido\n","valid_nodes = [\n","    n for n, attr in G2.nodes(data=True)\n","    if not np.isnan(attr.get('ManagementSalary', np.nan))\n","]\n","\n","# Creamos un subgrafo con sólo esos nodos\n","G_filtered = G2.subgraph(valid_nodes).copy()\n","\n","# Resumen del filtrado\n","print(f\"Nodos originales: {G2.number_of_nodes()}, aristas originales: {G2.number_of_edges()}\")\n","print(f\"Nodos tras filtrar NaN: {G_filtered.number_of_nodes()}, aristas tras filtrar: {G_filtered.number_of_edges()}\")\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"HXSQhwgTzanM","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1746387955217,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":178,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"16f1e7ba-1236-45eb-ab58-0fdb8b2ed858"},"id":"HXSQhwgTzanM","execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Nodos originales: 1005, aristas originales: 16706\n","Nodos tras filtrar NaN: 753, aristas tras filtrar: 9746\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 2.- Separa el conjunto de datos en subconjuntos de entrenamiento y prueba (proporción 80-20)."],"metadata":{"id":"hCSwbhSv0UOS"},"id":"hCSwbhSv0UOS"},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# 1. Extraemos los nodos válidos y sus etiquetas\n","nodes = np.array(list(G_filtered.nodes()))\n","y = np.array([G_filtered.nodes[n]['ManagementSalary'] for n in nodes])\n","\n","# 2. Split estratificado para mantener proporción de clases\n","train_nodes, test_nodes, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(\n","    nodes, y,\n","    test_size=0.20,\n","    random_state=42,\n","    stratify=y\n",")\n","\n","# 3. Crear subgrafos opcionales (si los necesitas para métricas de red separadas)\n","G_train = G_filtered.subgraph(train_nodes).copy()\n","G_test  = G_filtered.subgraph(test_nodes).copy()\n","\n","# 4. Informar tamaños\n","print(f\"Nodos totales: {len(nodes)}\")\n","print(f\"→ Entrenamiento: {len(train_nodes)} nodos\")\n","print(f\"→ Prueba:       {len(test_nodes)} nodos\")\n","print(f\"Etiquetas entrenamiento:\\n{pd.Series(y_train).value_counts(normalize=True)}\")\n","print(f\"Etiquetas prueba:\\n{pd.Series(y_test).value_counts(normalize=True)}\")\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"3ePOWGdfza-8","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1746387967686,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":86,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"912cda8c-58c6-4459-d169-fba521e15312"},"id":"3ePOWGdfza-8","execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Nodos totales: 753\n","→ Entrenamiento: 602 nodos\n","→ Prueba:       151 nodos\n","Etiquetas entrenamiento:\n","0.0    0.842193\n","1.0    0.157807\n","Name: proportion, dtype: float64\n","Etiquetas prueba:\n","0.0    0.84106\n","1.0    0.15894\n","Name: proportion, dtype: float64\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["###3.-Ajusta un modelo a los datos usando alguna técnica de aprendizaje adecuada. Puedes utilizar como predictores métricas que caractericen a los nodos (de centralidad, distancia, conexión, ...)."],"metadata":{"id":"77gyQpJj0Z3q"},"id":"77gyQpJj0Z3q"},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# 1. Calcular métricas de nodo sobre el grafo filtrado\n","degree    = dict(G_filtered.degree())\n","closeness = nx.closeness_centrality(G_filtered)\n","betweenness = nx.betweenness_centrality(G_filtered, weight='weight')\n","eigenvector = nx.eigenvector_centrality(G_filtered, max_iter=500)\n","\n","# 2. Montar DataFrame de características\n","features = pd.DataFrame({\n","    'degree':     pd.Series(degree),\n","    'closeness':  pd.Series(closeness),\n","    'betweenness':pd.Series(betweenness),\n","    'eigenvector':pd.Series(eigenvector),\n","})\n","\n","# 3. Preparar X_train, X_test usando los nodos ya separados\n","X_train = features.loc[train_nodes]\n","X_test  = features.loc[test_nodes]\n","\n","# y_train, y_test ya están definidos\n","\n","# 4. Instanciar y ajustar el modelo\n","model = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=100, random_state=42)\n","model.fit(X_train, y_train)\n","\n","# 5. (Opcional) Mostrar importancia de variables\n","importances = pd.Series(model.feature_importances_, index=X_train.columns)\n","print(\"Importancia de las características:\\n\", importances.sort_values(ascending=False))\n","# Calcular importancias (ejecutar antes)\n","importances = pd.Series(\n","    model.feature_importances_,\n","    index=X_train.columns\n",")\n","plt.figure()\n","importances.sort_values().plot(kind='barh')\n","plt.title('Importancia de las Características')\n","plt.xlabel('Importancia')\n","plt.ylabel('Métrica de Nodo')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":591},"id":"7-_HPkvF0nZU","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1746388124286,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":12031,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"4c9df34b-518b-409a-acc9-68c97282898a"},"id":"7-_HPkvF0nZU","execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Importancia de las características:\n"," betweenness    0.326748\n","eigenvector    0.266457\n","closeness      0.240595\n","degree         0.166200\n","dtype: float64\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["###4.-Evalúa la calidad del modelo sobre el conjunto de prueba usando el área bajo la curva (tu modelo debe tener por lo menos un AUC de  0.82  evaluada sobre el conjunto de prueba)."],"metadata":{"id":"3BBHGe0f0eqL"},"id":"3BBHGe0f0eqL"},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# 1. Obtener probabilidades positivas para la clase “1”\n","y_proba = model.predict_proba(X_test)[:, 1]\n","\n","# 2. Calcular el AUC\n","auc = roc_auc_score(y_test, y_proba)\n","print(f\"AUC en conjunto de prueba: {auc:.4f}\")\n","\n","# 3. Dibujar la curva ROC\n","RocCurveDisplay.from_predictions(y_test, y_proba)\n","plt.title(\"Curva ROC – Conjunto de Prueba\")\n","plt.xlabel(\"Tasa de Falsos Positivos\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Tasa de Verdaderos Positivos\")\n","plt.show()\n","\n","# 4. Verificar cumplimiento del umbral mínimo de AUC\n","if auc < 0.82:\n","    print(\"⚠️ AUC < 0.82: considera ajustar hiperparámetros o probar otro modelo.\")\n","else:\n","    print(\"✅ AUC ≥ 0.82 alcanzado. ¡Buen trabajo!\")\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":507},"id":"RYsWNO8U1Jmn","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1746387904330,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":658,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"abb5cbf0-7139-4474-ddcc-197f3e3412bc"},"id":"RYsWNO8U1Jmn","execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["AUC en conjunto de prueba: 0.9349\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["✅ AUC ≥ 0.82 alcanzado. ¡Buen trabajo!\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["##Curva ROC con área sombreada"],"metadata":{"id":"OZtB5Ju-2uLr"},"id":"OZtB5Ju-2uLr"},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# 2. Dibuja la curva y sombreado\n","plt.figure()\n","plt.plot(fpr, tpr, label=f'ROC curve (AUC = {roc_auc:.3f})')\n","plt.fill_betw